A Blinkit/Eternal SDE-1 fundamentals round asked a series of OS, data-structure and database questions:

- what happens when a process **creates a thread**;
- **process vs thread** and **context switching**;
- **ArrayList vs LinkedList** internals;
- **clustered vs non-clustered indexes**;
- **when an index hurts**, **how the database chooses an index**, and **composite indexes**.
